  "hook_reason": "My 15+ years delivering AI/ML solutions and enterprise transformation, including architecting real-time telemetry systems and LLM evaluation stacks, aligns with Cloudflare’s AI-embedded operating model and the Senior Named Account Executive’s focus on AI infrastructure adoption.",
  "body": "The role calls for translating AI infrastructure into strategic business outcomes. In a previous role, I led the technical delivery of real-time WebSocket telemetry servers for 10k+ device concurrency, reducing P95 latency to under 200 ms and directly improving user response time. The position also emphasizes AI-assisted workflows; I stood up an end-to-end Langfuse + Phoenix evaluation stack that scored hallucination, latency, and cost across high-volume daily LLM generations, reducing error budget breaches by 38% in a simulated production environment. Full lifecycle collaboration is central, and as Scrum Master on a major government reform program I convened a cross-discipline technical war room that produced a binding automation recommendation in under three hours and steered Distribution UI delivery to 95%+ completion, working across engineering, testing, and operations. My experience leading 5+ cross-functional squads and facilitating workshops for 40+ executives has honed a collaborative, servant-leadership approach that aligns with Cloudflare’s principled and transparent culture.\n\nI would welcome a conversation about how my delivery leadership and AI solution architecture can support Cloudflare’s strategic engagement with Adelaide-headquartered enterprises and SA Government. I am available for a call at your convenience and can provide further detail on the outcomes I have driven in complex, regulated environments."
}
